@startuml
title Student Attendance System - Use Case Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Account holder" as Account
actor Administrator as Admin
actor Lecturer
actor Student
actor "Unauthenticated API client" as Guest

Account <|-- Admin
Account <|-- Lecturer
Account <|-- Student

rectangle "Student Attendance System" {
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Register account\n(API only)" as Register
  usecase "Create users" as Users
  usecase "Manage courses and\nlecturer assignments" as AdminCourses
  usecase "Manage enrollments" as AdminEnrollments
  usecase "Review system-wide and\nsession attendance reports" as AdminReports
  usecase "Create / view own courses" as LecturerCourses
  usecase "Enroll students and\nview course roster" as LecturerEnrollments
  usecase "Create attendance session\nand display QR code" as CreateSession
  usecase "Supply lecturer location" as LecturerLocation
  usecase "Capture location using\nmobile setup QR" as MobileLocation
  usecase "Restore active session\nand close session" as Sessions
  usecase "Review session attendance\nand course statistics" as LecturerReports
  usecase "View enrolled courses" as StudentCourses
  usecase "Open QR link and\nmark attendance" as MarkAttendance
  usecase "Acquire student location" as StudentLocation
  usecase "Validate session, enrollment,\nduplicate attendance and distance" as Validate
  usecase "View own attendance\nhistory and summary" as StudentReports
}

Account -- Login
Guest -- Register
Admin -- Users
Admin -- AdminCourses
Admin -- AdminEnrollments
Admin -- AdminReports
Lecturer -- LecturerCourses
Lecturer -- LecturerEnrollments
Lecturer -- CreateSession
Lecturer -- MobileLocation
Lecturer -- Sessions
Lecturer -- LecturerReports
Student -- StudentCourses
Student -- MarkAttendance
Student -- StudentReports

CreateSession ..> LecturerLocation : <<include>>
MobileLocation ..> LecturerLocation : <<extend>>\n[mobile setup selected]
MarkAttendance ..> StudentLocation : <<include>>
MarkAttendance ..> Validate : <<include>>

note bottom of Login
Protected API use cases require a valid JWT and the appropriate role.
Login is a precondition, rather than a repeated included use case.
end note
note bottom of MobileLocation
The phone submits a short-lived setup token, without a JWT.
Creating the request and polling its status require lecturer authentication.
Direct browser location capture is also available.
end note
note bottom of Register
POST /api/auth/register is public in the current routes.
The React interface has no registration page.
end note
@enduml
